R-ST16 R-SO14 R-SO15 R-C14 R-C15 R-C16 R-C12 R-RU1 R-NS3 R-C7 (slice 084): `tln setup` with no default and nothing installed takes the latest compiler of the channel (`RocInstall.latest!`, the code that R-SO14 shares). The list `min-release-age-exclude` of `config.toml` lifts the age for a nightly (name `roc-lang/nightlies`). Setup has no project, so only `config.toml` counts (R-C14). Run 1: a pattern, the young nightly is the default, with a note. Run 2: no list, the older nightly. Run 3: patterns that do not match a nightly. Run 4: the switch is off, so a pattern gives no compiler. No download in any run.
